OL,3,GNEWSACharity duck race cancelled over
OL,4,Ariver pollution
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity duck race has been cancelled
OL,7,Fafter concerns were raised about sewage
OL,8,Fpollution in the river.
OL,10,FThe annual event was due to take place
OL,11,Fon Sunday on the River Tutt in
OL,12,FBoroughbridge, North Yorkshire.
OL,14,FYorkshire Water confirmed it had been
OL,15,Fcarrying out investigations in nearby
OL,16,Fhomes, prompting organisers to call off
OL,17,Fthe event and offer discounts to those
OL,18,Fwho had pre-purchased rubber ducks.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
