OL,3,GNEWSACharity duck race cancelled over
OL,4,Ariver pollution
OL,5,
OL,6,FSimon Wade, owns pubs in the area and
OL,7,Fruns the event, said it was
OL,8,F"disheartening because it's not
OL,9,Fsomething in this day and age you'd
OL,10,Fexpect to be an obstacle for you".
